      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那种感觉，简直就像时间停止了一般。\n她刚才，确实是这么说的。『另一个世界的黄金旅程』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2aec932975579894c638206735561b988b6163f0bf07448d7acb8c56b2f11b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
