    {
      "uid": "zhcn:232e896c2dcbb52c7ea28302",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你刚才看到的赛事，虽然与此处相似，却有着决定性的不同——\n那是确实存在于另一边的，过去的一部分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c583c12b0bb34a73bde20e9ebf521f7f2d43176d793a91cb76bc940cc883315",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
