    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a13126c2ad5afc82b545a9df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………你这家伙，看来完全没有怀疑我啊。\n倒不如说，你那种眼神——",
      "source_fingerprint": "343aa3088fb08c24529ee0eb974741829ecff3762be1a02990d186f6e06879ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8b3c6a0154864126ef9711",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你打算追寻着记忆做些什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50d0c5deb01e867b94292e84ce9b6cfeccba31f897a85c070e8fcc61964373d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09f120fb3dce8b88b69f5b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你打算追寻着记忆做些什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "50d0c5deb01e867b94292e84ce9b6cfeccba31f897a85c070e8fcc61964373d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
