    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70db721ec4d6e22f52acea0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈。你果然是个怪人。嘛，正因如此吧。\n……总之，现在能告诉你的大概就是这些了。你满足了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b8e337529e5584c2c9f2c5003882255f1ee29f52b9e94485bc26662ab8efd7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec762d43da7376d66236b175",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……只是单纯地享受，吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "630d939f128577b9f2bd18ea9d9c1245f0f6bcbf0122871098749ad5a588fb39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb39a7fb789c178e19014254",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金旅程",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fef5d2663b1ecd0a83b6099bc2404725a8014ed3026be24cf29a2dbd3ead384",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab78e18a17ffc3822db556b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只是单纯地享受其中罢了。现在的我，有着只属于现在的步调。\n正因如此，看到的风景肯定也会变得不同吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dffa7906f0bd35dd8f35b89455d0b5b86b720a5ce5071f3aedf27742da9a0a8f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284b538ff7fda4da9f44f494",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金旅程",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fef5d2663b1ecd0a83b6099bc2404725a8014ed3026be24cf29a2dbd3ead384",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d185dec0d153b24c346de748",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………那么，我差不多该走了。\n如果有缘的话，就在别处再会吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "819db9bc71875a93310995640e281e41eed973f180d3e1d880fba895942f3a51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72da9cac5e7737c545aab93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "望着被夕阳映照着的黄金旅程离去的背影，我不禁心想。\n……据我所知，另一个世界的她的蹄迹，原本与胜利相距甚远。",
      "source_fingerprint": "576bef3ad01c8b9e10e3a30050cf979144352122f3c18687714447e01013e16f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:895ceeef5a977588c9db033c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然她知道这一点，却仍打算踏上同一条道路吗。\n如果真是那样的话……——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2060a04bbc0916983df70ef0375875281e62ab04aff5cc6e95db20b75beb4748",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:966070054980f86a5e5be165",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（如果是那种跑法的话，一定能达到更高的……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "05a361f76aac0e5f967a777516843c8fa5ef18a537dbde3dbc4506777c828cd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b694e2f42088fe35ae8cff94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――――脑海中掠过。那是不惧意料之外的风雨，\n欢快、强劲，仿佛要强行开辟出道路般锐利的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a39d7ce02ae7260a0bc0d5919261c4ede22e38e59538cf3840e577cf335c5242",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e346bb9f8398ddd1e2878aea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……一个念头，在胸中结成了果实。\n那是我所见证的，名为黄金旅程的赛马娘身上的可能性——",
      "source_fingerprint": "48f35030db71ba0fa89b256927f22c260264b8ff4091d0a3f5c4cb2c20673b0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b9bc778a688f1e6ae05665",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是通往尚未得见的“黄金”的，一种预感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74f8fb7edc9601e05c5ea60eb06e4a942f97c6ac60608c6705156bad0d1acb1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4808f8726f0037b237639807",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——……那天，我听说她要出赛，\n便特意前来观看一场选拔赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa348c803e6fd54b3e8e55eafbf5006ac0ccd1af3ffc4584d49f93ef179ad87f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14da1d766febeb4a02c41794",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金旅程",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fef5d2663b1ecd0a83b6099bc2404725a8014ed3026be24cf29a2dbd3ead384",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
