    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:515bd196e88483a248ec18ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从第一次近距离看到那种跑法时起，我就一直在想。\n黄金旅程，是位蕴藏着黄金般天赋的、出色的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a515ad6c9edeb256e09bda7f10bc19a3a898def1de54f4955e495bceda1554",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
