    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a9fb7c0fa0b4f35749f6c8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那样的她，却打算只是去追寻另一个世界的自己曾走过的路。\n那或许确实有着绝赞的风景在等待着。但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eaad465e910f0c55b113139045bc173fc97ba96c3eb4e4b85afa8b28f89bbd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4227bf251ba6fc227901c5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "初次见面时，你也曾说过的吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb06ed46c4860d41f69f6d4906b8972fed018813d00428b4b7196a29c2107267",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135004.json",
      "json_path": [
