    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0ccf16f790626c748e9886d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，干脆就走到能走到的最远方吧。\n这是我的立论——旅程这种东西，果然还是意料之外才更有趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd748695c8ee26450aea574d61f9f2d557370f8fb1fbf05e2bfbb243301e9fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
